        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we operate a third-party investment management business providing property management and advisory services to three unconsolidated institutional joint ventures, in which we have partial ownership interests, and one private fund (collectively, the “Managed Funds”).",
