        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Further, we provide our Neighbors with responsive customer service and marketing tools, as well as other sophisticated solutions, such as a centralized accounting, billing, and tax review platform to facilitate our daily operations.",
